# =============================================================================
# SAFETY FIRST — this repository must contain ONLY R code.
# The MAHAN / Melghat cohort data are sensitive (young children; household
# geolocation) and must NEVER be committed. This file blocks everything by
# default and re-allows only source code and documentation.
# =============================================================================

# 1) Block everything
*

# 2) Allow git to descend into directories
!*/

# 3) Re-allow ONLY code and docs
!*.R
!README.md
!.gitignore
!LICENSE

# 4) Belt-and-suspenders: explicitly block data / output / binary formats
#    (in case a file is ever placed at the repo root)
*.csv
*.tsv
*.dta
*.sav
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda
*.tif
*.tiff
*.nc
*.grd
*.shp
*.dbf
*.shx
*.prj
*.gpkg
*.geojson
*.kml
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.pdf
*.html
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*_gpsdata*
output/
**/output/
data/
Data/
accessibility/
GISproject/
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.RData
